      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For SFO–Bangkok on January 15, the main choice is whether you’d rather reach Bangkok on January 16 or take the quickest of the direct-award schedules that arrive January 17. The award quotes below are dated observations, not live availability. The cash search is a separate end-to-end baseline, not an award option or a confirmed party total.",
