    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "If an earlier arrival matters most, the Singapore Airlines itinerary gets you in at 10:25 p.m. on January 16. It leaves SFO at 11:45 a.m. January 15 and takes 19 hours 40 minutes overall. That’s the one-day-earlier arrival compared with the late-night Aeroplan option, but it means leaving SFO about 11½ hours earlier; the two journeys also quote different award programs, so their points aren’t directly comparable.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
